flowchart TB
accTitle: Recovery readiness precedes traffic failover
accDescr: A prebuilt cross-Region replica is promoted after a failure and writer fencing, then application configuration and readiness checks precede DNS failover to the recovery endpoint.
A["Prebuilt cross-Region replica"] --> B["Failure detected, old writer fenced"]
B --> C["Promote replica"]
C --> D["Writable database ready"]
D --> E["Configure and validate recovery app"]
E --> F["Recovery endpoint healthy"]
F --> G["DNS failover and client reconnect"]
class A storage
class B,C,E decision
class D,F,G output
